tps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123588","id":5723359685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVSOJxQ","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T00:55:14Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T01:18:31Z","body":"I've updated the example, it seems part of the repro conditions is having a main screen\n\nEDIT: May be related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/84673","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5723359685/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5724435399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123588#issuecomment-5724435399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123588","id":5724435399,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVTPzxw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T02:51:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T02:51:49Z","body":"- In that case its probably from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113051 cc @KoBeWi \n\nIt depends on which main screen tab is open, only for 2D and 3D it will be called.\n\nAlso note that `_has_main_screen` is now deprecated.\n\nThe purpose of `_handles` is to tell the editor if it can call `_edit` and `_make_visible`. \nPreviously the editor called `_handles` in some cases even when there was no chance it would call `_edit` and `_make_visible`, like when its on the game tab. \nNow it only calls `_handles` when there is an actual chance. And I think it still calls `_edit` and `_make_visible` when it is supposed to.\nSo I don't think its a problem that it doesn't call `_handles` as often.\n\nCan you give more details about how you use `_handles` and your plugin not reacting to nodes?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5724435399/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5728321233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123588#issuecomment-5728321233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123588","id":5728321233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVW8-0Q","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T09:51:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T09:53:07Z","body":"The `_handles()` for main screen plugins will only be called when the main screen is going to edit something. If for example Script editor is visible, the editor won't automatically switch screens when selecting nodes, so there will be no attempt to handle them. If you want `_handles()` to be called at all times, `_has_main_screen()` should return false.\n\n> Also note that _has_main_screen is now deprecated.\n\nIt's not. It's still used to differentiate between plugins that have main screen and plugins that don't. The behavior I explained is one of the differences.\n\nAlthough maybe deprecating it might make sense eventually. I'm not yet sure if this differentiation is useful tbh. For now this could be better documented.\n\nEDIT:\nActually the method _is_ marked as deprecated 🤦‍♂️ This needs to be sorted out.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5728321233/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5729443325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123588#issuecomment-5729443325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123588","id":5729443325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVYBd_Q","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T11:38:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T11:40:00Z","body":"The thing is my main screen has to update when selection changes, any plugin that relies in this behaviour will need to connect to some signal to update itself instead of getting the _handles and _edit callback","author